0.1.0 - 2026-07-14

Initial community draft:
- Loads ConfigCat Browser JavaScript SDK v1.1.0 from jsDelivr.
- Initializes a ConfigCat singleton client.
- Supports Auto Polling, Lazy Loading, and Manual Polling.
- Supports Global and EU-only data governance.


